We get asked about "No Churn" ice creams a lot.....and I mean A LOT!!

There are only so many ways to make no churn ice cream and this is one of them. The ingredients are very simple and there is no ice cream machine required.

Cookies n Cream No Churn Ice Cream - for this you will need:

1 Tin (400g) Condensed Milk
600ml Double/Heavy Cream
Vanilla Extract
1 Pack of Cookies (cream filled)

Simply put your condensed milk and cream in a bowl and whisk until thick. Then add you vanilla extract and mix it in. Finally add your chopped/crushed cookies of choice and freeze. 

If you want Ice Cream but do not have an Ice Cream maker, try this. I will upload some other variations on "No Churn" ice creams over the coming months all with different flavours. 

